{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "5_01_005_23",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:ac9fef29ac1e6c224c90c93d1b71b0d4cfebb660a9de76d38adebfd5650bde41",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:5_01_005_23:5_01_005_23_a:cmd-000014:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4a31b943df9183a8a0674da2a20774883354224a2410975d2d60c16048a81e68",
      "text": "这是情人节的巧克力。\n不介意的话请收下！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_005_23:5_01_005_23_a:cmd-000021:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:419f4a0c7d6631edc46ec9e58a4b1f3b04b4280eaa531ca832498c016cdecb67",
      "text": "……我就料到如果是你的话今年大概也会准备巧克力。\n……但没想到你真带过来了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_005_23:5_01_005_23_a:cmd-000025:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:838590aa81603efe5addaa0a05749eb1671dfb1adad4c390b30499e1d2a48fac",
      "text": "嘛，倒正好成了休息时不错的糖分补充。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_005_23:5_01_005_23_a:cmd-000027:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:150f78644e05bada370ffb60c080b724a1c4e4797988d979e84f7d392896ed04",
      "text": "薰先生，你刚才在看电视吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_005_23:5_01_005_23_a:cmd-000032:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7c7ef726106e77d9c10a6e0452f50a84983a461262f7a56184a1492bb1cb496a",
      "text": "啊啊。正好，之前我们出演的那部电视剧\n正在重播。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_005_23:5_01_005_23_a:cmd-000037:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4eb1c17a8297b3c72f38e2d5ca26cd01cbf7a13e666159c833ad237114c50e94",
      "text": "正因为是站在现在的角度，才能看清许多地方。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_005_23:5_01_005_23_a:cmd-000040:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3189d0fc7e50f299340a13c5a7e94870be2d454d601a67902ad50fff1443e132",
      "text": "让我再次深刻地体会到，这部电视剧对DRAMATIC STARS来说，\n确实是必须经历的一笔宝贵经验。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_005_23:5_01_005_23_a:cmd-000045:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:421f4edc38aaf3fac502f42bd40565cae5785b80f65c8f191e3f653b28668bbf",
      "text": "无论是在提高知名度的意义上，\n还是在其他层面的意义上。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_005_23:5_01_005_23_a:cmd-000050:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2b76a3f1f9a08e94b48985e5baee5d37312ed566fd4227466b2461097b4e3b48",
      "text": "对于你为我们争取到了这份工作，\n我很感激。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_005_23:5_01_005_23_a:cmd-000057:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d4f9388f758f1f2714e24e810a15af7c2ca7ff4e87b59994b9a8b1b39a971213",
      "text": "……怎么，那是什么表情。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_005_23:5_01_005_23_a:cmd-000062:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:054e554d40c88566eae88e46dfb04afa1fa5472ab237ae0cbf644eb630441759",
      "text": "先跟你说清楚，我可不是因为收了你的巧克力\n才对你态度放宽的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_005_23:5_01_005_23_a:cmd-000067:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:379d3e5aac95e712ba11cfa9d6f226e7ae98a338000d2972077b7f7010f0dd50",
      "text": "事情办完了的话，就回你自己的座位上去。\n我想集中精神看电视剧。",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
